.expo-map/

android/

# graft's local graph cache — regenerable, not committed (run `graft build`).
# kept as the unanchored "graft/" on purpose: graft's own ensureGitignored()
# checks for that exact line and re-appends it every build otherwise. The
# negations below re-admit .claude/skills/graft/ (the graft skill itself,
# which this pattern would otherwise also match).
graft/
!/.claude/skills/graft/
!/.claude/skills/graft/**
